    { q: "The Patent Act of 1836 notably introduced…", a: ["Substantive examination by a Patent Office", "A 20-year patent term", "First-to-file"], c: 0, x: "The 1793 Act had been a mere registration system. The 1836 Act created examiners and restarted patent numbering." },
